    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Duffy Property are delighted to present this beautiful three bedroom detached house sitting on an impressive 1.4 acres in the highly sought after area of Pullagh, Kildangan, Co. Kildare.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a superb country property within a short drive of the M7 & M9 Motorways that is in pristine condition throughout and is ready to move in to. The house was built in 2018 to an extremely high standard and it has an A2 BER Rating. \r\nThe property is not overlooked to the front or back and enjoys fantastic privacy with picturesque views of the surrounding countryside including rolling green fields, farmland and a beautiful stream / river to the rear of the property which is a fantastic amenity on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nThe house is accessed through a recessed entrance with secure electric gates and a new tarmacadam driveway that leads from the front to the back of the house. 18 new solar panels have been installed on the roof. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to 1,206 Sq. Ft. (112 Sq. M.) \r\n\r\nThe house benefits from a host of fantastic features including: superb A BER Rating, oil central heating with modern oil boiler, solid fuel stove, 18 solar panels, PVC double glazed windows & doors, large windows allowing extensive natural light, large 1.4 acre site with beautiful views, well maintained front & back gardens with large manicured grass lawns, large detached garage with roller door, three spacious double bedrooms and two bathrooms.\r\n\r\nExcellent location in a quiet country setting only 10 minutes from Monasterevin & 12 minutes from Kildare Town close to all amenities & services including: Supermarkets (Tesco, Lidl, Aldi, SuperValu), shops, banks, restaurants, pubs, cafes etc.\r\n\r\nThere are a host of excellent creches, primary & secondary schools to choose from within a short drive of the house: Kildangan (3 Minutes), Nurney (5 Minutes), Monasterevin (10 Minutes), Kildare Town (12 Minutes), Newbridge (20 Minutes), Athy (15 Minutes) & Kilcullen (20 Minutes).\r\n\r\nThe house is located only 12 minutes from the M7 Motorway (Exit 13) making commuting to Dublin extremely convenient. Kildare & Monasterevin Train Stations are also only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nKildare Village Shopping Outlet, The Curragh & the National Stud & Japanese Gardens are within a short drive. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate its high quality."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Internal Features:\r\n\r\nPristine, turnkey condition throughoutModern house only 8 years old\r\nSuperb A2 BER Rating (Green Rating)\r\nGenerous living space extending to 1,206 Sq. Ft. (112 M. Sq.) \r\nStunning views of the surrounding countryside\r\nSuperb fixtures & fittings Boiling water tapBrushed chrome sockets & switchesBeautiful wood panelling\r\nOil fired central heating with solid fuel stove\r\nPVC double glazed windows & doors \r\nThree double bedroomsTwo bathrooms\r\n\r\n\r\nExternal Features:\r\n\r\nPicturesque, quiet country locationSecure entrance with electric security gates\r\nLarge detached garage to rearNew tarmacadam driveway\r\nNot overlooked to the front or rear\r\nSurrounded by rolling green fields & agricultural land \r\nStunning views of the surrounding countryside\r\nLarge 1.4 acre site\r\nBeautiful mature front & back gardens & grass lawns\r\nLarge driveway leading from the front to the rear of the house\r\nExcellent potential to extend further\r\nOutside tap & lighting\r\nExcellent quiet location only 10 minutes from Monasterevin & 12 minutes from Kildare Town\r\nOnly a few minutes from M7 Motorway\r\nOnly 12 minutes from Kildare Village Shopping Outlet\r\nWithin minutes of a large number of excellent creches & primary & secondary schools"
